                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The thought of your child receiving a life-threatening health diagnosis is unimaginable. When the unthinkable does happen, families know they can count on the incredible team at Nemours Children\u2019s Health in Northeast Florida.\n\nI\u2019m proud to support them on House Appropriations.",
