                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Over the past 2 years, our healthcare workers have been forced to choose between individual freedom & providing life-saving treatment to patients. I was proud to cosponsor the Freedom for Healthcare Workers Act & will continue protecting Americans\u2019 rights.",
